<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[60vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16] pt-32 pb-16"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367982/eurocert/c21.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-40" alt="Electrical and electronic products"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16] via-[#030a16]/50 to-transparent"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 relative z-10 text-center"><div class="inline-block px-6 py-2 rounded-full mb-8 border border-white/30 bg-white/10"><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-[0.5em] heading-font">CE Marking (LVD / EMC / RoHS)</span></div><h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide mb-4 leading-none heading-font">Electrical &amp; <span class="text-eurogold-400">Electronic Products</span></h1><p class="text-sm md:text-xl text-white/80 font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] heading-font">Power Your Products into the European Market - Safely &amp; Compliantly</p></div></section><section class="py-16 md:py-24 relative z-10 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase mb-4 heading-font">Overview of EU Directives</h2><p class="text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">Electrical and electronic products placed in the EU must comply with multiple directives ensuring safety, performance, and environmental responsibility.</p></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-200/50 hover:border-eurogold-400/60 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-eurogold-500/10 transition-all duration-300 bg-white"><div class="w-14 h-14 bg-eurogold-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><i class="fas fa-bolt text-eurogold-600 text-xl"></i></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Low Voltage Directive (LVD) 2014/35/EU</h3><p class="text-slate-600">Ensures electrical equipment operates safely within voltage limits (50-1000V AC / 75-1500V DC).</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-200/50 hover:border-eurogold-400/60 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-eurogold-500/10 transition-all duration-300 bg-white"><div class="w-14 h-14 bg-eurogold-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><i class="fas fa-bolt text-eurogold-600 text-xl"></i></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Electromagnetic Compatibility (EMC) Directive 2014/30/EU</h3><p class="text-slate-600">Ensures devices do not generate or are not affected by electromagnetic interference.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-200/50 hover:border-eurogold-400/60 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-eurogold-500/10 transition-all duration-300 bg-white"><div class="w-14 h-14 bg-eurogold-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><i class="fas fa-bolt text-eurogold-600 text-xl"></i></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">RoHS Directive 2011/65/EU</h3><p class="text-slate-600">Restricts hazardous substances like lead, mercury, cadmium in electrical equipment.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16] via-[#0a1628] to-[#030a16] relative z-10"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4 heading-font">Our Core Capabilities</h2></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-200/30 hover:border-eurogold-400 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-eurogold-500/10 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Product Assessment &amp; Directive Mapping</h3><p class="text-white/70 text-sm">Identify all applicable directives and standards based on product type and usage.</p></div><div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-200/30 hover:border-eurogold-400 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-eurogold-500/10 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Harmonized Standards Selection</h3><p class="text-white/70 text-sm">Application of EN standards to demonstrate presumption of conformity.</p></div><div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-200/30 hover:border-eurogold-400 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-eurogold-500/10 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Risk Assessment &amp; Safety Analysis</h3><p class="text-white/70 text-sm">Hazard identification and mitigation aligned with EU safety requirements.</p></div><div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-200/30 hover:border-eurogold-400 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-eurogold-500/10 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Testing Coordination (LVD / EMC)</h3><p class="text-white/70 text-sm">End-to-end support with accredited labs for electrical safety and EMC testing.</p></div><div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-200/30 hover:border-eurogold-400 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-eurogold-500/10 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Technical Documentation</h3><p class="text-white/70 text-sm">Preparation of complete Technical File including circuit diagrams, BOM, test reports, risk analysis, and design descriptions.</p></div><div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-200/30 hover:border-eurogold-400 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-eurogold-500/10 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Declaration of Conformity (DoC)</h3><p class="text-white/70 text-sm">Drafting and validation of EU Declaration of Conformity.</p></div><div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-xl bor